      "machineHash": "eeef7da53440243a35303678462715b4a9e4b1b471f20434cd771abe4683c226",
      "machineText": "Flag ini mencakup `wails3 build`, `wails3 package`, `wails3 sign`, dan\\\n`wails3 task \u003cname\u003e`. `wails3 dev` *belum* terpengaruh—pemantau pengembangan\\\nmasih menggunakan pipeline-nya sendiri.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The flag covers `wails3 build`, `wails3 package`, `wails3 sign` and\\ `wails3 task \u003cname\u003e`. `wails3 d…",
