      "machineHash": "18b95fe73c71597c5f2e216b149f1d8d9aea1b026fb54e0864f6f59cca4f6ca2",
      "machineText": "`env` dan `vars` *digabungkan per kunci*, dan override diprioritaskan jika terjadi benturan.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`env` and `vars` *merge per key*, with the override winning on collisions.",
