      "machineText": "Sekarang `build` menjalankan perintah produksi Anda dan `smoke` tersedia, tanpa\\\nperubahan pada Taskfile yang di-commit.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Now `build` runs your production command and `smoke` is available, with no\\ changes to the committed…",
